From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Luke Craig <lacraig3@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 09:38:58 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] hw/core: build the configurable machine and its QAPI schema

Wires in the overlay's hw/core/configurable-machine.c and
qapi/panda-machine.json: a built-in machine, "configurable", for every
target, whose memory map (RAM, ROM, unimplemented-peripheral and alias
regions, file-backed contents), peripherals (any bus-less or system bus
device type, by QOM type, with MMIO bases, IRQ wiring and properties),
CPU (-cpu) and entry point are machine properties set before machine init.
The list-valued properties use QAPI types, as the machine's smp-cache
does, so -M configurable,region.0.base=...,device.0.type=... is parsed and
type-checked by the generated visitors, and the same value can be set over
QMP in preconfig. pandare2's MachineBuilder writes them.
---
 hw/core/meson.build   | 1 +
 qapi/meson.build      | 1 +
 qapi/qapi-schema.json | 1 +
 3 files changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/hw/core/meson.build b/hw/core/meson.build
index 8737666bbb1a91ff2e43a242aedfd1220430ea96..e8175325bb9707f9118ed3c023ca8b32b6d5cc18 100644
--- a/hw/core/meson.build
+++ b/hw/core/meson.build
@@ -37,6 +37,7 @@ system_ss.add(files(
   'machine.c',
   'nmi.c',
   'null-machine.c',
+  'configurable-machine.c',
   'panda-modules.c',
   'numa.c',
   'qdev-fw.c',
diff --git a/qapi/meson.build b/qapi/meson.build
index a46269b5a0c926cc99051d2f9cbfe477e4c5da57..062646dea2aec296cb2fbf7d35a4b6215b43eefe 100644
--- a/qapi/meson.build
+++ b/qapi/meson.build
@@ -67,6 +67,7 @@ if have_system
     'rocker',
     'misc-arm',
     'misc-i386',
+    'panda-machine',
     'tpm',
     'uefi',
   ]
diff --git a/qapi/qapi-schema.json b/qapi/qapi-schema.json
index b93dd68d94c63d451fd69f96bc2065f93ce78447..a01e03679c7c856e70795229fe863a660d5bc497 100644
--- a/qapi/qapi-schema.json
+++ b/qapi/qapi-schema.json
@@ -76,3 +76,4 @@
 { 'include': 'cryptodev.json' }
 { 'include': 'cxl.json' }
 { 'include': 'uefi.json' }
+{ 'include': 'panda-machine.json' }
